  "title": "Deconstructed Stuffed Pepper Casserole",
  "description": "Cauliflower &#34;rice&#34; stands in for regular rice in this simple, deconstructed stuffed bell pepper casserole, reducing both carbs and calories without sacrificing any taste.",
